{"step_index":97,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T13:02:32Z","thinking":"**Analyzing welcome page display**\n\nThe prompt indicates a requirement to change the display logic of the \"Instant Credential & Blockchain Lookup\" card. This card, currently on the welcome page, should only appear after a user successfully authenticates and verifies login credentials.\n\nInitial inspection targets `templates/index.html` where the welcome page is defined. The goal is to identify and modify the conditional rendering logic to implement the user's requirement.\n\n\n**Refactoring UI for Authentication**\n\nThe verification input section will be removed from `index.html`. A new call-to-action banner will replace it, guiding users towards the verification portal. The navigation bar will update the \"Verify Credential\" link, directing logged-in users to the appropriate dashboard section or prompting login otherwise.\n\nVerification functionality will be implemented within `dashboard.html`, contingent upon successful user authentication and authorization, meeting the requirement that verification happens after login. This ensures the correct access flow.\n\n\n**Implementing Role-Based Verification Tab**\n\nA new verification tab with the specified UI elements will be added within `dashboard.html`. The tab's visibility and default selection will be role-based, ensuring verifiers see it first. The visibility of other tabs and buttons will also be adjusted according to user roles.\n\nA redirect mechanism to the new verification tab will be integrated within `/verify` in the controller. This seamless loading targets authenticated users to the dashboard. The absence of authentication results in a redirect to the login page.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Madziva\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\qualification-verification-system\\\\src\\\\main\\\\resources\\\\templates\\\\dashboard.html\"","EndLine":"110","StartLine":"45","toolAction":"\"Viewing dashboard.html tabs\"","toolSummary":"\"Check tabs in dashboard.html\""}}]}
